ion results", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PRs/1383-codex-account-restore-admission-add-durable-account-restore-review-planning.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The full backup suite passed 106 tests; focused planner, workspace and key coverage passed 10 tests against final behavior; TypeScript passed; full ESLint had 0 errors and 420 existing warnings; changed-file lint passed. The negative account inventory fixture was adjusted to exceed its actual unchanged processing bound, and a valid 90,001-node value has positive admission coverage.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "prs_1383_codex_account_restore_admission_add_durable_account_restore_review_planning_remaining_product_gates", "label": "Remaining product gates", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PRs/1383-codex-account-restore-admission-add-durable-account-restore-review-planning.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Remaining gates include full managed, security, settings and device capture; complete dependency closure; canonical restore writers and historical recovery; server jobs and receipts; encryption and key recovery; installed product UI; independently verified provider durability; measured 100 GB\u2013100 TB acceptance; and separately deferred Android and physical-media delivery.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "prs_1383_codex_account_restore_admission_add_durable_account_restore_review_planning_graphify_refresh", "label": "Graphify structural and semantic refresh", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "PRs/1383-codex-account-restore-admission-add-durable-account-restore-review-planning.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Structural refresh produced 72,418 nodes, verified new source paths in the active manifest and regenerated po